    "https://jobs.mdx.ac.uk/Org/Faq/": {
      "title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
      "description": "Frequently Asked Questions - Careers at Middlesex University Skip to main content Home Login Register Jobs Home Current Vacancies How to Apply Contact Us FAQ Terms of Use Contact Us Cookies Accessibility This site requires the use of cookies as defined by our Terms and Conditions . \n        We have provided a detailed description of how cookies work and are used on the site . \n        To accept cookies, please click the \"Accept Cookies\" button. Accept Cookies Home Login Register More ▼ Home Login Register Careers at MDX Careers at Middlesex Jobs Home Current Vacancies How to Apply Contact Us FAQ More ▼ Frequently Asked Questions We have a number of frequently asked questions (FAQs) that may be able to help you with your application or any technical problems you may be experiencing. FAQs on making an application FAQs on how to use the system Search Alternatively you may search our FAQs if you have a term to search for and are finding it difficult to find the information when browsing the FAQs. Search FAQs Applications Technical Existing Account / Staff Member Do you have an existing account, or are you a member of staff? Login New User For new applicants, please register for an account Register Terms of Use | Contact Us | Cookies | Accessibility"
