    "https://jobs.mdx.ac.uk/vacancies.aspx": {
      "title": "Current Vacancies",
      "description": "Current Vacancies - Careers at Middlesex University Skip to main content Home Login Register Jobs Home Current Vacancies How to Apply Contact Us FAQ Terms of Use Contact Us Cookies Accessibility This site requires the use of cookies as defined by our Terms and Conditions . \n        We have provided a detailed description of how cookies work and are used on the site . \n        To accept cookies, please click the \"Accept Cookies\" button. Accept Cookies Home Login Register More ▼ Home Login Register Careers at MDX Careers at Middlesex Jobs Home Current Vacancies How to Apply Contact Us FAQ More ▼ Current Vacancies Our current vacancies are listed below. All vacancies close at 23:59 pm on the closing date. For all internal vacancies, staff will have to register using their MDX email account. You will only see internal vacancies if you are logged in . Sort by: Category Location School/Service Show: All Jobs Full Time Part Time Full Time Term Time Part Time Term Time Apply Academic (4) Professional (8) Full list of current opportunities (12) If you can't find an opportunity at the moment use our email service to be alerted to opportunities in the future. Find Jobs Jobs by Email Jobs by RSS Search Jobs Search Advanced Job Search Useful Links Careers at Middlesex About Us MU Services Limited Existing Account / Staff Member Do you have an existing account, or are you a member of staff? Login New User For new applicants, please register for an account Register Latest Vacancies Library Experience Assistant x2 Placement and Work Experience Consultant Placement and Work Experience Team Leader View All Vacancies Terms of Use | Contact Us | Cookies | Accessibility"
