      "description": "Jobs by Email - Careers at Middlesex University Skip to main content Home Login Register Jobs Home Current Vacancies How to Apply Contact Us FAQ Terms of Use Contact Us Cookies Accessibility This site requires the use of cookies as defined by our Terms and Conditions . \n        We have provided a detailed description of how cookies work and are used on the site . \n        To accept cookies, please click the \"Accept Cookies\" button. Accept Cookies Home Login Register More ▼ Home Login Register Careers at MDX Careers at Middlesex Jobs Home Current Vacancies How to Apply Contact Us FAQ More ▼ Jobs by Email We  offer a free email service to alert you to jobs you may be interested in. This service will send you all the new vacancies in categories you may be interested in. You can refine your requirements with keywords and a desired salary range. You must Register or Login to use Jobs by Email. Find Jobs Jobs by Email Jobs by RSS Search Jobs Search Advanced Job Search Useful Links Careers at Middlesex About Us MU Services Limited Existing Account / Staff Member Do you have an existing account, or are you a member of staff? Login New User For new applicants, please register for an account Register Latest Vacancies Library Experience Assistant x2 Placement and Work Experience Consultant Placement and Work Experience Team Leader View All Vacancies Terms of Use | Contact Us | Cookies | Accessibility"
